{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24983","headline":"题孙君山亭 · 牟融","name":"题孙君山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长年乐道远尘氛，静筑藏修学隐沦。\n吟对琴樽庭下月，笑看花木槛前春。\n闲来欲着登山屐，醉里还披漉酒巾。\n林壑能忘轩冕贵，白云黄鹤好相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}